Z||000002||Haze_Performance||02-23-2001||03:29 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Hank is Here:<BR><B>I have been looking for the interior SEM paint in the grey to paint plastic.  To my dismay  have not been able to locate it.  I have looked in two Wal-Marts, a K-Mart, Traget;I looked in the auto section and the other paints section.    Where else can I find this interior paint?  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I went to the SEM website. I searched for a dealer near me.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.semproducts.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.semproducts.com/</A> <P>I found:<P><B>SEM Color Coat System (Aerosol)<P>Central US Marketing<BR>10614 Celtic Court<BR>Mokena, IL. 604408<BR>708-479-3808</B><P>Good Luck  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ttttttt.gif"> </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>PFF Members Photo Page</A><BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1431213" TARGET=_blank><BR>Photopoint Gallery</A>||||reg||6
